<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14015" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτελ-εσμᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>productive of material objects,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη ἀ.,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωρητική</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρακτική,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				11.197
			</span></i>: generally, <i>productive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.48
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.475
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>astrologically influential,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				90
			</span></i>; <i>of</i> or <i>for astrology,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				332.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>), ἡ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				900.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				293.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτελεσματικά,</span> name of a
				<i>work on astrology</i> by <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Al.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ -κοί</span>”
				<i>astrologers,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					193.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
